# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

# Environment files. The real .env holds JWT_SECRET and DB_PASSWORD; only the
# template is tracked. Without this, a `git add -A` on a cPanel account would
# commit the signing secret for the whole deployment.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Build output and deploy archives. The frontend is built (vite) into dist/,
# copied into public_html/, and shipped as fieldpulse-*.zip; none of those
# artefacts are authored in the repo. Only the api shims (.htaccess, .user.ini,
# api/) are tracked under public_html — the built index.html, assets/, service
# worker and PWA icons are generated every build. docs/DEPLOYMENT.md documents
# the copy.
dist.zip
fieldpulse-*.zip
backend-update.zip
public_html/assets/
public_html/favicon.svg
public_html/index.html
public_html/manifest.webmanifest
public_html/pwa-*.png
public_html/registerSW.js
public_html/sw.js
public_html/workbox-*.js

# Runtime storage created by the app, not source. Holds uploaded evidence
# (quarantine, processed/{verified,review,rejected}), operational logs, and
# worker temp files. The logs are already covered by *.log above, but the
# uploaded photos are not, and committing real field submissions — with their
# embedded GPS and timestamps — would be a privacy incident, not just clutter.
private_storage/fieldpulse/

# Browser end-to-end harness artefacts. .e2e_docroot is a real deploy of dist/
# over a copy of public_html and is rebuilt on every run; .e2e_creds.json holds
# the agent credentials the run signs in with; .e2e_faults.json is the harness's
# fault-injection switch, read by the test router only; .e2e_profiles are the
# persistent browser profiles, which hold real device keys. playwright-report/
# and test-results/ hold failure output. None of it belongs in the repository.
.e2e_docroot/
.e2e_creds.json
.e2e_faults.json
.e2e_profiles/
playwright-report/
test-results/

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
